1
00:03:11,111 --> 00:03:17,111
What happens when you sleep?

2
00:06:22,222 --> 00:06:28,222
Paranormal Activity is a horror, mystery film directed by Oren Peli.

3
00:09:33,333 --> 00:09:39,333
After a young, middle-class couple moves into what seems like a typical suburban house, they become increasingly disturbed
by a presence that may or may not be demonic but is certainly the most active in the middle of the night.

4
00:12:44,444 --> 00:12:50,444
Katie Featherston, played by Katie Featherston.

5
00:15:55,555 --> 00:16:01,555
Micah Sloat, played by Micah Sloat.

6
00:19:06,666 --> 00:19:12,666
The Psychic, played by Mark Fredrichs.

7
00:22:17,777 --> 00:22:23,777
Amber, played by Amber Armstrong.

8
00:25:28,888 --> 00:25:34,888
Diane, played by Ashley Palmer.

9
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:46,000
Exorcism Nanny (uncredited), played by Crystal Cartwright.

10
00:31:51,111 --> 00:31:57,111
Paranormal Activity is a 2007 American found-footage supernatural horror film
produced, written, directed, photographed, and edited by Oren Peli.

11
00:35:02,222 --> 00:35:08,222
It centers on a young couple (Katie Featherston and Micah Sloat) who are
haunted by a supernatural presence inside their home.

12
00:38:13,333 --> 00:38:19,333
They then set up a camera to document what is haunting them.

13
00:41:24,444 --> 00:41:30,444
The film uses found-footage conventions that were
mirrored in the later films of the series.

14
00:44:35,555 --> 00:44:41,555
Originally developed by Peli as an independent feature and given film
festival screenings in 2007, the film was shot for $15,000.

15
00:47:46,666 --> 00:47:52,666
It was then acquired by DreamWorks Pictures, then a Paramount Pictures subsidiary, who
modified the film, particularly with a new ending that cost an additional $200,000.

16
00:50:57,777 --> 00:51:03,777
It was given a limited U.S.

17
00:54:08,888 --> 00:54:14,888
release on September 25, 2009, and then a
nationwide release on October 16, 2009.

18
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:26,000
The film earned nearly $108 million at the U.S.

19
01:00:31,111 --> 01:00:37,111
box office and a further $85 million internationally
for a worldwide total of $194 million.

20
01:03:42,222 --> 01:03:48,222
Paramount would then solely acquire the U.S.

21
01:06:53,333 --> 01:06:59,333
rights for $350,000.

22
01:10:04,444 --> 01:10:10,444
It is often cited as the most profitable film ever made, based on proportionate return on investment, although
such figures are difficult to verify independently as this is likely to exclude marketing costs.

23
01:13:15,555 --> 01:13:21,555
The film is the first installment in the Paranormal Activity film series.

24
01:16:26,666 --> 01:16:32,666
A prequel, Paranormal Activity 2, was released in 2010.

25
01:19:37,777 --> 01:19:43,777
The film explores themes of supernatural, haunting,
psychic, entity, demonic possession.

26
01:22:48,888 --> 01:22:54,888
The tone is mind_bending and dark and intense.
